        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "4f0e4557-3549-5195-aabc-d225f8458342",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kenneth Arnold\n- Events: World UFO Day, Roswell UFO Incident, unidentified flying object sighting\n- Places: United States, Mount Rainier, Washington\n\nFacts:\n- On June 24, 1947, aviator Kenneth Arnold claimed to see nine unusual objects flying in tandem near Mount Rainier, Washington.\n- Kenneth Arnold's June 24, 1947 sighting is generally considered the first widely reported unidentified flying object sighting in the United States.\n- World UFO Day marks June 24 as the date of Kenneth Arnold's widely reported United States sighting.\n- World UFO Day marks July 2 as commemorating the supposed UFO crash in the 1947 Roswell UFO Incident.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
